pref-title = Split-View Reader
pref-section-basic = Basic Settings
pref-follow-focus =
    .label = Follow mouse focus to switch primary view
pref-follow-focus-desc = When enabled, clicking a non-primary view switches the current primary view to it. If no primary view is set, focus changes do not re-enable sync until you set one manually.
pref-command-shortcut = Command shortcut:
pref-command-shortcut-record = Set shortcut
pref-command-shortcut-recording = Press a shortcut… Press Esc to cancel
pref-command-shortcut-reset = Restore default
pref-command-shortcut-desc = Click “Set shortcut” and press a combination containing Ctrl, Alt, Shift, or Meta. If it conflicts with Zotero or another plugin, choose a different shortcut. Press Esc to cancel.
pref-command-shortcut-modifier-required = The shortcut must include Ctrl, Alt, Shift, or Meta.
pref-split-tabs-title = Show split tabs as
pref-split-tabs-title-desc = Only split-view tabs use this setting. Regular Zotero reader tabs keep Zotero's own tab-title setting.
